1|# Task 34: one music-mode cycle behind the style control
2|
3|Repo martinmw13/LectorIA-meta, worktree /workspace/wt-34, branch `music-mode-cycle` (from latest main). Read AGENTS.md first and follow every repo rule (co-author trailer via the hook, file-size hook, check:secrets, isolation). Do not run `next start`, no paid API calls, do not touch data/. Another agent is editing app/page.tsx, app/home/*, core/epub*, core/library* and docs/contracts.md: do NOT touch those. Pictures files (app/folio/use-pictures.ts, image-pane, inline-figures, scene-page, theme.ts) are in another open PR: do not touch them either.
